{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["אשר יבא עליו מים יטמא — whoever wishes to give a reason for the commandments in a worldly manner and as a response to the heretics: the Holy One, blessed be He, did not render species of foods and liquids susceptible to impurity until they are prepared for the purpose of food and the addition of water — that is the beginning of their preparation and the essence of their significance for eating."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:38.921124451Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}